{"sections":{"main":{"type":"main-page","disabled":true,"settings":{"content_width":"80ch"}},"image_with_text_overlay_DT9MEY":{"type":"image-with-text-overlay","blocks":{"liquid_HikeCn":{"type":"liquid","settings":{"liquid":"<p STYLE=\"FONT-FAMILY: SERIF; font-size: 22px;\">Why Merino<\/p>"}},"subheading_kCgCUj":{"type":"subheading","disabled":true,"settings":{"text":"Merino"}},"heading_JkXJY9":{"type":"heading","settings":{"text":"NOT YOUR GRANDMOTHER'S WOOL","heading_tag":"h2"}},"richtext_Wn4ter":{"type":"richtext","settings":{"content":"<p>Warm in winter. Cool in summer. Soft against skin. Fresh for days. <br\/>Once you wear it, everything else feels like a compromise.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["liquid_HikeCn","subheading_kCgCUj","heading_JkXJY9","richtext_Wn4ter"],"name":"Image with text overlay","settings":{"full_width":true,"allow_transparent_header":false,"enable_parallax":false,"image_size":"lg","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Screenshot_2026-05-19_at_14.34.12.png","mobile_text_position":"place-self-end-center text-center","desktop_text_position":"sm:place-self-end-center sm:text-center","text_color":"#ffffff","overlay_color":"#000000","overlay_opacity":10}},"media_with_text_D6bJVT":{"type":"media-with-text","blocks":{"image_dmWD6a":{"type":"image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/hf_20260507_221809_160a634d-dcc1-4693-b4e0-6fadf16d05bb.png","media_width":50,"media_position":"start","text_position":"place-self-center-start text-start","icon":"none","icon_width":36,"subheading":"Odour resistant","title":"","content":"<h4>WEAR MORE - WASH LESS<\/h4><p>Merino fibres naturally reduce odour build-up, keeping your knit fresher for longer between washes. Less laundry. Less effort. More wear. Perfect for long days, travel, and everyday life.<\/p>","link_text":"","link_url":"","background":"#ffffff","background_gradient":"","text_color":"#000000","text_gradient":"","button_background":"","button_text_color":""}}},"block_order":["image_dmWD6a"],"name":"Media with text","settings":{"full_width":false,"alternate_media_position":false,"spacing":"none"}},"media_with_text_kz34QK":{"type":"media-with-text","blocks":{"image_XpXVgT":{"type":"image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/hf_20260507_235739_7ea2ce1e-1fce-4a03-9d1c-008667cd8bf5.png","media_width":50,"media_position":"start","text_position":"place-self-center-start text-start","icon":"none","icon_width":60,"subheading":"Temperature regulating","title":"","content":"<h4>ONE KNIT EVERY SEASON<\/h4><p>Merino adapts to your environment naturally. It keeps warmth close when temperatures drop and releases heat when they rise,  from cold mornings to overheated offices to late evenings out.<\/p>","link_text":"","link_url":"","background":"#ffffff","background_gradient":"","text_color":"#000000","text_gradient":"","button_background":"","button_text_color":""}}},"block_order":["image_XpXVgT"],"name":"Media with text","settings":{"full_width":false,"alternate_media_position":false,"spacing":"none"}},"media_with_text_9R8zc3":{"type":"media-with-text","blocks":{"image_kyCwDk":{"type":"image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/hf_20260507_170413_28f76e83-f409-4673-bcbd-bd7c5cf72993.png","media_width":50,"media_position":"start","text_position":"place-self-center-start text-start","icon":"none","icon_width":60,"subheading":"Soft, never scratchy","title":"","content":"<h4>WOOL WITH A SKIN FEEL<\/h4><p>At just 18.5 microns, finer than a human hair, merino fibres bend softly against skin rather than scratch it. No itch. No compromise. Gentle enough for sensitive skin, comfortable enough for every day.<\/p>","link_text":"","link_url":"","background":"#ffffff","background_gradient":"","text_color":"#000000","text_gradient":"","button_background":"","button_text_color":""}}},"block_order":["image_kyCwDk"],"name":"Media with text","settings":{"full_width":false,"alternate_media_position":false,"spacing":"none"}},"media_with_text_bgTehg":{"type":"media-with-text","b